# The calendar's lines: what it says when you train, rest, or reach the boss.
# PLACEHOLDER lines until the real ones are written.
#
# They play in the calendar's own box (data/dialogue_styles/calendar.tres), where today's
# choices were. Each title is a Day Action's Dialogue Title (data/day_actions/...).
# Lines without a "Name:" are narration: no name tab.
# Lines can use {{action}} (its title, e.g. Train Culture), {{changes}} (Culture +5, or more than
# one: Culture +3, Heart +2), and {{attribute}} (Culture) / {{amount}} (5): the first thing it changes.

~ train

You spend the day on your {{attribute}}.
{{attribute}} +{{amount}}.
=> END

~ rest

You sleep in. Nothing happens. It's nice.
=> END

~ boss

Boss day! The boss fight isn't built yet, so you skip ahead to the next chapter.
=> END
